    "No raw argv/environment/service response output and no implicit-consent env overrides.",
    "Non-recursive fixture setup; fake mutation commands terminate at first boundary, except the explicit postbuild arm whose fake cargo declares an embargo then exits0 so the second preflight can be tested. Preserve fixture evidence instead of cleanup walks."
